oint vs. collector ES exporter).\n- Rounds: 2\n- Round 1 found one blocking gap: the draft didn't clarify that the collector-exporter delta-only restriction never applied to counters, only histograms, which could have left readers uncertain about counter behavior on that path.\n- Round 2 (after adding \"This restriction doesn't apply to counters.\"): no blocking comprehension gaps remained.\n\nRelated to #648\n\nThis draft PR was produced autonomously by docs-agent-experimental in experimental mode.\n\nSafe-output PRs do not trigger CI by default. A maintainer must trigger the required checks manually.","branch":"docs-agent/issue-648-histogram-temporality","title":"Scope histogram delta-temporality limitation to collector Elasticsearch exporter"},"name":"create_pull_request"}}
